 571:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/chart/../../core/lv_obj_style_gen.h **** /**
 572:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/chart/../../core/lv_obj_style_gen.h ****  * Get gradient definition. The pointed instance must exist while Widget is alive.
 573:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/chart/../../core/lv_obj_style_gen.h ****  * NULL to disable. It wraps `BG_GRAD_COLOR`, `BG_GRAD_DIR`, `BG_MAIN_STOP` and
